s>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Engbert</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Oculomotor control in a sequential search task.</article-title><source>Vision Res</source><volume>47</volume><fpage>2426</fpage><lpage>2443</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17662332</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list><fn-group><fn fn-type="conflict"><p><bold>Competing Interests: </bold>The authors have declared that no competing interests exist.</p></fn><fn fn-type="financial-disclosure"><p><bold>Funding: </bold>This work was supported by Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft (grants EN 471/2-1, KL 955/6-1, and KL 955/14-1).</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>